Subject: Chat Workbench Quote Provenance Justification
Date: 2026-05-14
Scope: Quote capture affordances and visible quote source provenance in the AlienHand workbench

& [ChatWorkbenchQuoteProvenanceSlice] is the quote-control polish for source-linked refinement
  + [specification_basis] is AlienHand/docs/irc-chat-refinement.sop
  + [processed_specification_basis] is AlienHand/docs/sjs/exploded/irc-chat-refinement.v2.exploded.sop
  + [frontier_basis] is [ImplementationFrontier: ChatRefinementV2] frontier_6
  + [ui_contract] is quote capture remains user-controlled while source provenance is visible at the rendered quote
