  + [parent_pointer] is AlienHand/thelounge
  + [implementation_files] are The Lounge client/components/AlienHandRefinementWorkbench.vue, The Lounge client/css/alienhand-chat.css, and AlienHand/python/alienhand_ai/payload_http.py

  = implemented: added Use source as quote for cut quote forms
  = implemented: added Use summary as quote for chapter quote forms
  = implemented: added fillQuoteDraft so quote prefill remains a UI draft action rather than automatic persistence
  = implemented: added visible Quote source labels to rendered quote blocks
  = implemented: shortened long source identifiers for quote provenance display while preserving full source_id in storage
  = implemented: added quote provenance footer styling
  = implemented: added runtime proof markers for quote prefill actions, quote source labels, and quote draft status
  = satisfies: frontier_6 because quote controls are easier to use while preserving anchor validation and provenance
  = satisfies: DataDrivenDesign because quote records still persist through source_type, source_id, excerpt, and provenance fields
  = satisfies: UIInteractionSpecification because prefill is explicit, reversible before submit, and visibly tied to source material
  = verification: npx eslint client\components\AlienHandRefinementWorkbench.vue --color passed
  = verification: npx prettier --check client\components\AlienHandRefinementWorkbench.vue client\css\alienhand-chat.css passed
